<title>USA: IPO FILING-IWL Communications Inc.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING-IWL Communications Inc.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name		 IWL Communications Inc</p>
<p>Stock symbol			IWLC.O</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $7.50-$8.50/shr</p>
